<title>USA: Maritime, Portland Natural seeking agreement.</title>
<headline>Maritime, Portland Natural seeking agreement.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Maine 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portland Natural Gas Transmission System and Maritimes &amp; Northeast Pipeline are negotiating on the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission's proposal they consider ways to limit environmental damage with their competing pipelines, Portland Natural spokesman John Flumerfelt told Reuters Monday.</p>
<p>When it gave preliminary approval to both proposals in July, FERC urged them to consider a jointly-owned pipeline or building on the same right-of-way where the pipelines follow the same routing.</p>
</text>
